  era: "1793\u20131822 \xB7 Section 20 \xB7 East India Company Rule \xB7 1765 \u2013 1858"
  title: Land revenue systems
  text: 'To fund itself, the Company experimented with land revenue settlements that fixed who paid tax and how much. Three main systems emerged in different regions: the Permanent Settlement, Ryotwari and Mahalwari.'
